# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages. Pages' native fallback (serve index.html
# when no 404.html exists) proved unreliable in production: deep links like
# /keys and /reset-password came back as empty 404s, which breaks every
# password-reset and verification link built from ui_base_url. This explicit
# catch-all makes the fallback deterministic. Static assets take precedence
# over _redirects rules, so only unmatched paths are rewritten.
/* /index.html 200
